  "title": {
    "zh": "双舱电量交接",
    "en": "Power Transfer Between Bays"
  },
  "concept": {
    "zh": "初始 ACC · 正负调拨 · 更新两座电舱",
    "en": "Starting ACC · Signed transfer · Two bay balances"
  },
  "brief": {
    "zh": "地址 0、1 是北舱和南舱的旧电量，地址 2 是从北舱划给南舱的调拨量，负数表示反向调拨。ACC 已收到北舱的新增电量。把调拨和新增电量都计入，写回两个电舱，把它们的总量写入地址 3 和 ACC。地址 2 的调拨记录要保留。一份程序要处理全部五组交接。",
    "en": "Addresses 0 and 1 hold the old balances of the north and south bays. Address 2 holds the amount transferred from north to south. A negative transfer goes the other way. ACC already holds the new charge arriving at the north bay. Update both bays, write their combined total to address 3 and ACC, and preserve the transfer at address 2. Use one program for all five handoffs."
  },
